abstract: >-
  Team Mobarmij's solution to the DrivenData DaT Parkinson's Challenge,
  classifying dopamine-transporter SPECT scans as normal or abnormal.
  The final private leaderboard result was 59th, with log loss 0.3054
  and AUROC 0.9379.
